  "html": "<h2>Standard Image with Alt Text</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://example.com/mountains.jpg\" alt=\"A scenic mountain landscape\"></p>\n<h2>Image with Title (maps to caption)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://example.com/team.png\" alt=\"Team photo\" title=\"Our engineering team in 2026\"></p>\n<h2>Image with Local Path</h2>\n<p><img src=\"./assets/logo.png\" alt=\"Logo\" title=\"Company logo\"></p>\n<h2>Image with Explicit Caption via HTML</h2>\n<img src=\"https://example.com/product.jpg\" alt=\"Product screenshot\" data-caption=\"The main dashboard view showing analytics\">\n\n<h2>Remote Image with No Alt</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://example.com/banner.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Multiple Images in Sequence</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://example.com/first.png\" alt=\"First\" title=\"First screenshot\">\n<img src=\"https://example.com/second.png\" alt=\"Second\" title=\"Second screenshot\">\n<img src=\"https://example.com/third.png\" alt=\"Third\" title=\"Third screenshot\"></p>\n",
